{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102688","id":2327686244,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Kvaxk","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102688","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102688.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102688.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102688","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102688/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102688/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102688/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7404873b6633e152a2b91d7ffb6218acbe02bb18","number":102688,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix TileMapLayer bug where dirty cells could be marked twice","user":{"login":"caleb98","id":5992481,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5OTI0ODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5992481?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/caleb98","html_url":"https://github.com/caleb98","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caleb98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caleb98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caleb98/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caleb98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caleb98/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caleb98/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caleb98/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caleb98/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caleb98/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Summary\r\n\r\n* Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/96339\r\n\r\nAdds additional checks to `TileMapLayer::_build_runtime_update_tile_data_for_cell` to ensure that dirty cells have not already been added to the dirty cells list before calling `dirty.cell_list.add(...)`. Previously, updating a cell and calling `notify_runtime_tile_data_update` in the same frame or through coroutines could cause ordering issues here resulting in a large number of error messages being printed.\r\n\r\nUsing the [MRC provided in the linked issue](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/96339#issuecomment-2381320465), I verified that the errors are no longer being printed, and calling `notify_runtime_tile_data_update` using `call_deferred` is no longer necessary\r\n\r\nI'm also attaching an MRC to this PR for the case where messages can still be printed when using `call_deferred` if coroutines are involved. Adding these additional checks prevent the error messages in this MRC as well: [Coroutine MRC](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18745103/gh-96339.zip)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7008779076,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABocF7RA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.3","name":"cherrypick:4.3","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.3.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g